# Goal
string task_id
uint8 priority
float32 x
float32 y
float32 z
float32 yaw
float32 timeout_sec
float32 stable_time_sec
---
# Result
bool success
uint8 final_state_code
uint16 error_code
string message
float32 elapsed_sec
---
# Feedback
string task_id
uint8 priority
builtin_interfaces/Time stamp
uint8 state_code
uint16 error_code
string message
float32 progress
float32 distance_error
float32 yaw_error
geometry_msgs/Pose current_pose
geometry_msgs/Twist current_twist
